    ('0490ef6d-5381-449d-aa8c-385ab7dbd8e7'::uuid, 'card_description', 'On Gozo, the walls of the Xagħra Stone Circle enclosed burial caves of the community that built nearby Ġgantija temple. Its dead were dismembered, their body parts buried in separate places.', 'The Xagħra Stone Circle originally consisted of a walled enclosure surrounding caves which were used as a necropolis. The Xagħra Stone Circle was first recorded by Jean Houel in 1788.', 'teaser-card-s002-rollback:0490ef6d-5381-449d-aa8c-385ab7dbd8e7:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s002: card_description ''The Xagħra Stone Circle originally consisted of a walled enclosure surrounding caves which were used as a necropolis. The Xagħra Stone Circle was first recorded by Jean Houel in 1788.'' restored on Xagħra Stone Circle', '12962b73e163bc6fc24ce51646c7a02d46de007cc02a8b26f38aa3757c7318e4|d378f0da89eebe8a7171369c6bd9a69b6525ebf0d009e78bc5c01feec5236875|d378f0da89eebe8a7171369c6bd9a69b6525ebf0d009e78bc5c01feec5236875', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-write-001", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-03/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "On Gozo, the walls of the Xagħra Stone Circle enclosed burial caves of the community that built nearby Ġgantija temple. Its dead were dismembered, their body parts buried in separate places."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-check-001 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-03/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "the Xagħra Stone Circle is on Gozo [S1]; walls enclosed its caves [S5]; the caves were used for burial [S2, S5]; it was the burial ground of the community that built the Ġgantija temple [S7]; the Ġgantija temple is nearby [S7]; the bodies of the dead were dismembered [S6]; the body parts were buried in separate places [S6]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-verify-003 (verify), VE