    ('16d9eae9-81b1-436e-bd93-e6aea4b4c818'::uuid, 'card_description', 'Samicum stood on a spur of a lofty mountain that leaves only a narrow pass by the coast. Nearby, a grove of wild olives surrounded a celebrated temple of the Samian Poseidon.', 'A 4th-century BC fortified town on a spur above the coast, built where the mountains nearly touch the sea. It guarded a crucial coastal pass.', 'teaser-card-s002-rollback:16d9eae9-81b1-436e-bd93-e6aea4b4c818:card_description', 'rollback of teaser-card-s002: card_description ''A 4th-century BC fortified town on a spur above the coast, built where the mountains nearly touch the sea. It guarded a crucial coastal pass.'' restored on Samicum', 'bcc15c5249917b776bb83781d5c22f928e192add1b7d4c02cab657c2c09a5347|2ba87d75da911053c1c87a2b188371f49fe6f242fdf0666a038811d30ebe850a|2ba87d75da911053c1c87a2b188371f49fe6f242fdf0666a038811d30ebe850a', '[{"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: writer teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-write-003", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-03/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Samicum stood on a spur of a lofty mountain that leaves only a narrow pass by the coast. Nearby, a grove of wild olives surrounded a celebrated temple of the Samian Poseidon."}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: checker teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-check-003 (check), PASS", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-03/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Samicum stood on a spur of a lofty mountain [S2]; the mountain leaves only a narrow pass by the coast [S2]; a temple of the Samian Poseidon stood nearby [S4]; the temple was celebrated [S4]; a grove of wild olives surrounded the temple [S4]"}, {"source": "lane WB run wb-ws-2026-09-27-03: verifier teaser-wb-ws-2026-09-27-03-verify-009 (verify), VERIFIED", "url": "output/remediation/teaser/runs/wb-ws-2026-09-27-03/OUTCOMES.jsonl", "quote": "Samicum was an ancient town (settlement) in Greece [SUPPORTED: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Samicum]; Samicum stood 